<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CorpGro half yr share beats budget.</title>
<headline>CorpGro half yr share beats budget.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     0.64</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   5.23</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   8.05</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.82</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		 76.95</p>
<p>Full name: Corpgro Ltd (stores)</p>
<p>NOTE - The recently-listed company did not provide comparable results for the six months to September 1995, but said results of all businesses acquired during the period were in line with or ahead of budgets and forecasts.</p>
<p>It said it expected taxed profits in the coming six months to be materially higher than those reported in the period under review. The company's policy is to declare dividends annually.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
